{
  "name": "Connector: Google Sheets (CRM)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Connector: Google Sheets (CRM or product-user list)\n\nThe free, no-CRM option. Also works as a **product-user list**: import this connector a second time, point it at your product-user export, and paste that copy's ID into the core Config as `product_users_connector_id`.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Import `sheet/valari-template.xlsx` into Google Sheets and fill in the Champions and Customers tabs.\n2. Paste the sheet ID into **Config** (from the URL: /spreadsheets/d/**ID**/edit). Add a Google Sheets credential to each Sheets node.\n3. If your columns are named differently, fix the expressions in **Map Champions** and **Map Accounts**.\n4. Copy this workflow's ID into the core **Config**.\n\n**Actions:** list_champions, list_accounts, record_move (appends a row to the Moves tab).\n\n**Publish** this workflow once it is set up (top right). n8n only lets scheduled and webhook-started runs call published workflows.\n\nContract: docs/connectors.md in the repo.",
        "height": 660,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "99b4a4e4-e9cb-48ec-af69-921a2b9677c5",
